>Thomas</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Van der Weijden</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Drenth</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Haverkort</surname><given-names>AFM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hooi</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Van der Laan</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>NHG-Standaard Cholesterol (eerste herziening)</article-title><source>Huisarts &#x00026; Wetenschap</source><year>1999</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>406</fpage><lpage>417</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rutten</surname><given-names>GEHM</given-names></name><name><surname>Verhoeven</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Heine</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>De Grauw</surname><given-names>WJC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cromme</surname><given-names>PVM</given-names></name><name><surname>Reenders</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Ballegooie</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiersma</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>NHG-Standaard Diabetes Mellitus Type II (eerste herziening)</article-title><source>Huisarts &#x00026; Wetenschap</source><year>1999</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>67</fpage><lpage>84</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walma</surname><given-names>EP</given-names></name><name><surname>Grundmeijer</surname><given-names>HGLM</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Prins</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Van den hoogen</surname><given-names>JPH</given-names></name><name><surname>Van der Laan</surname><given-names>JR